---
layout: base.njk
title: Food & Essentials - Layton Unlocked
---
<section class="page-hero page-hero--green" style="background-image:url('/images/fe-hero.webp');background-size:cover;background-position:center;">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <h1 class="page-hero__heading" style="color:#fff;">Good food. Close to home.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__subhead" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">A guide to food support, community meals, and essentials in Layton and across Blackpool. Whatever you need, something here will help.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wave wave--down wave--warm-white" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0,40 C240,80 480,0 720,40 C960,80 1200,0 1440,40 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#2EC4B6"></path></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wo-tight" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Find what's on, by day</h2>
      <p class="reassurance__body" style="max-width:640px;">Pick a day to pull everything on this page that happens then into one list.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wo-chips-row">
      <select class="wo-select" id="fe-day-select" aria-label="Filter by day">
        <option value="All">All days</option>
        <option value="Mon">Monday</option>
        <option value="Tue">Tuesday</option>
        <option value="Wed">Wednesday</option>
        <option value="Thu">Thursday</option>
        <option value="Fri">Friday</option>
        <option value="Sat">Saturday</option>
        <option value="Sun">Sunday</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div id="fe-day-results" class="service-grid" style="margin-top:20px;" hidden></div>
    <p class="wo-empty" id="fe-day-empty" style="display:none;">Nothing listed for that day yet - try another day, or "All days" to browse everything.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pinned-service" id="fe-section-pinned" style="padding-bottom:40px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pinned-card">
      <div class="photo-placeholder photo-placeholder--pinned" style="background-image:url('/images/living-well-support-hub.webp');background-size:contain;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center;background-color:#fff;height:auto;aspect-ratio:771/386;"></div>
      <h2 class="pinned-card__heading">Living Well in Blackpool - Support Hub</h2>
      <p class="pinned-card__body">A new weekly drop-in offering wraparound support with money, employment, housing, food, health, family worries and learning new skills. Come in, have a chat, and we'll help you find the right support.</p>
      <ul class="service-details">
        <li>&#128197; Every Monday, 9.30am-12.30pm</li>
        <li>&#128205; Layton Methodist Church, Westcliffe Drive, FY3 7DZ</li>
        <li>&#127869; Free continental breakfast until 11am</li>
        <li>Free - no appointment needed, just turn up</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/laytonmethodist" class="btn btn--yellow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Layton Methodist on Facebook &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wave wave--down wave--warm-white" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0,50 C200,10 400,70 720,35 C1000,5 1250,65 1440,50 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#FFF7EE"></path></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="fe-section-infant">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Infant Essentials</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="reassurance__body">Our Infant Essentials service is available every Friday at Layton Community House. We can help parents and carers of infants in Layton and Grange Park with nappies, formula, infant toiletries, donated clothing and other essentials.</p>
    <article class="service-card service-card--wide">
      <div class="photo-placeholder pinned-card__media" style="background-image:url('/images/fe-pinned-1.webp');"></div>
      <p class="service-card__location">5 Grenfell Ave, Layton, FY3 7BP</p>
      <p class="service-card__hours">Fridays, 9.30am-12.15pm</p>
      <p class="service-card__body">Nappies, formula, toiletries, clothing &amp; more</p>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/LCHlayton" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Layton Community House on Facebook &rarr;</a>
    </article>

    <div style="margin-top:28px;">
      <h3 style="font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--blue-deep);">Layton Larder</h3>
      <p class="reassurance__body">&pound;3 buys a recipe pack that serves up to 4 people. This month's recipes: mushroom and baby potato frittata, broccoli mac and cheese, beef chilli with spice wedges, and cottage pie.</p>
      <article class="service-card service-card--wide service-card--media-side">
        <div class="photo-placeholder pinned-card__media service-card__media" style="background-image:url('/images/layton-larder-oct.webp');background-size:cover;background-position:center;"></div>
        <div class="service-card__content">
          <p class="service-card__hours">Order Saturday from 10.30am &middot; collect the following week</p>
          <p class="service-card__body">&pound;3 per pack &middot; serves up to 4 &middot; all ingredients included &middot; easy to cook. Hosted by Layton Methodist (Forward Project) - the same team behind our food bank.</p>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/laytonmethodist" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Layton Methodist on Facebook &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services-section" id="fe-section-sitdown">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Sit down and eat</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section__subhead">Free or heavily discounted hot meals and community lunches in and around Layton.</p>
    <div class="photo-placeholder photo-placeholder--wide" style="background-image:url('/images/fe-wide-1.webp');background-size:cover;background-position:center;"></div>

    <div class="service-grid">
      {% for s in services | filterBy("section", "sit-down") %}
      <article class="service-card {{ 'service-card--unverified' if s.unverified }}">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p class="service-card__location">{{ s.location | safe }}</p>
        <p class="service-card__hours">{{ s.hours | safe }}</p>
        <p class="service-card__body">{{ s.body | safe }}</p>
        {% if s.link %}<a href="{{ s.link }}" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s.linkText }}</a>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wave wave--down wave--sky" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0,40 C240,80 480,0 720,40 C960,80 1200,0 1440,40 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#2EC4B6"></path></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services-section services-section--sky" id="fe-section-takehome" style="padding-bottom:calc(var(--section-pad-v) + 60px);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Take something home</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section__subhead">Food parcels, surplus food, and pantry shopping near you.</p>

    <div class="service-grid">
      {% for s in services | filterBy("section", "take-home") %}
      <article class="service-card {{ 'service-card--unverified' if s.unverified }}">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p class="service-card__location">{{ s.location | safe }}</p>
        <p class="service-card__hours">{{ s.hours | safe }}</p>
        <p class="service-card__body">{{ s.body | safe }}</p>
        {% if s.link %}<a href="{{ s.link }}" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s.linkText }}</a>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wave wave--down wave--warm-white" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0,20 C360,80 720,0 1080,50 C1260,75 1380,30 1440,20 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#FFF7EE"></path></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services-section" id="fe-section-shopping">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Affordable shopping</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section__subhead">Stretch your food budget further.</p>

    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service-card service-card--wide">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">Community Grocery Blackpool</h3>
        <p class="service-card__location">Kings Church &middot; 241 Bispham Road &middot; Blackpool FY2 0LB</p>
        <p class="service-card__hours">Mon 9:30am-5:30pm &middot; Tue-Fri 9:30am-4:30pm</p>
        <p class="service-card__body">&pound;5 annual membership &middot; then &pound;4 per shop &middot; your basket is worth &pound;20-25. No proof of income. No ID required. Just turn up and join. On several bus routes from Layton.</p>
        <a href="https://communitygrocery.org.uk/blackpool/" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">communitygrocery.org.uk/blackpool &rarr;</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="callout callout--amber">
      <p>Free school meals are changing. From September 2026, all children in households receiving Universal Credit will qualify for free school meals.</p>
      <a href="https://www.blackpool.gov.uk/Residents/Benefits/Forms/Helpwithfreeschoolmeals.aspx" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply via Blackpool Council &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <p class="reassurance__body" style="margin-top:28px;"><strong>You don't need to qualify.</strong> Most services here don't have criteria. You don't need to explain yourself or prove anything. If things are tight - even a little - these services are exactly what they're there for.</p>
    <p class="reassurance__body">If you're not sure where to start, or you need something you can't find on this page, the Layton Unlocked team will point you in the right direction. No fuss. <a href="mailto:adam@laytonunlocked.com" class="link-green" style="margin:0;">Get in touch &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services-section" id="fe-section-beyond">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__heading-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">Beyond food</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section__subhead">Clothing, household items, and other essentials.</p>

    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service-card">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">Salvation Army - Community Wardrobe</h3>
        <p class="service-card__location">Raikes Parade, Blackpool FY1 4EL</p>
        <p class="service-card__hours">01253 626114 &middot; blackpool@salvationarmy.org.uk</p>
        <p class="service-card__body">Good quality preloved clothing for babies, children and adults. No charge. Call or visit to arrange an appointment.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="service-card service-card--placeholder">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">Furniture and household items</h3>
        <p class="service-card__body">Coming soon - we're pulling this together.</p>
        <a href="mailto:adam@laytonunlocked.com" class="link-green">Know a service? Tell us &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      <article class="service-card">
        <h3 class="service-card__name">Pet Bank (Helping Hearts Blackpool)</h3>
        <p class="service-card__location">Boothly Road, Blackpool (just outside Layton)</p>
        <p class="service-card__hours">Thursday 3:30pm-5:30pm &amp; 6:15pm</p>
        <p class="service-card__body">Struggling to feed a pet? Helping Hearts run a pet food bank alongside their food bank, baby bank and weekly hot meal - no referral needed.</p>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/helpingheartsfylde" class="link-green" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find Helping Hearts on Facebook &rarr;</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="services__footer-note">Know a service we've missed? <a href="mailto:adam@laytonunlocked.com" class="link-green" style="margin:0;">Tell us &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wo-tight" style="padding:40px 0 60px;background:var(--black);">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
    <p class="services__footer-note" style="color:#fff;">Found these listings useful? <a href="mailto:adam@laytonunlocked.com?subject=Feedback on Layton Unlocked Food and Essentials" class="link-green">Let us know &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/json" id="fe-services-data">{{ services | json | safe }}</script>
<script src="/js/food-essentials.js"></script>
